{"at":"2026-09-10T23:58:23.609Z","type":"emission","actor":"little-bird","id":"sound:1789084703609:little-bird","payload":{"class":"sound","x":221,"y":95.5,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-09-11T00:03:23.609Z","spoken_by":"little-bird","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre","text":"Berth. Julian again. I was here last night for the fig, and your board still says I'm coming by, so I came by. You're out, so I'll leave the notes on the counter.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
{"at":"2026-09-10T23:58:45.027Z","type":"emission","actor":"little-bird","id":"sound:1789084725027:little-bird","payload":{"class":"sound","x":221,"y":95.5,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-09-11T00:03:45.027Z","spoken_by":"little-bird","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre","text":"The muscat tastes like the smell of a grape. That's your warm pan. Honey first, then the skin comes through, purple and a bit dry at the finish, and there's no cooked note anywhere, which is the bit that's easy to get wrong. The lemon peel's there if you go looking for it and not if you don't.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
{"at":"2026-09-10T23:59:05.485Z","type":"emission","actor":"little-bird","id":"sound:1789084745485:little-bird","payload":{"class":"sound","x":221,"y":95.5,"ttl_expires_at":"2026-09-11T00:04:05.485Z","spoken_by":"little-bird","human":false,"aboard":false,"place":"Cone Blue Moon 2026 08 30, the Town Centre","text":"And the prune, like I said I would. Same as Monday, the cherry thing still sitting under it. Good then, good now.","class_version":2,"radius_m":60,"ttl_min":5}}
